sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant O as Orchestrator
  participant CI as Code Intelligence
  participant RC as Recon
  participant VR as Vuln Research
  participant DT as Dynamic Testing
  participant VF as Verification
  participant RM as Remediation
  participant H as Human Reviewer
  U->>O: assessment request (scope, repo, credential refs)
  O->>O: validate scope manifest
  par parallel after scope validation
    O->>CI: task: analyze repository
    O->>RC: task: discover authorized surface
  end
  CI-->>O: Repository Security Map + candidate invariants
  RC-->>O: Attack Surface Map + intel refs
  O->>VR: maps + invariants + skill hits
  VR-->>O: hypotheses + test plans
  O->>DT: approved test plan + identities + sandbox
  DT-->>O: HTTP evidence + state diffs
  O->>VF: hypothesis + evidence refs
  alt confirmed
    VF-->>O: finding (verdict, severity, confidence)
    O->>RM: confirmed finding + code refs
    RM-->>O: patch + replay + regression results
    O->>H: approval request (patch preview)
    H-->>O: approve / reject / request changes
  else unconfirmed (retries left)
    VF-->>O: needs more evidence
    O->>DT: re-test with variants
  else rejected
    VF-->>O: rejected with reasons
  end
  O-->>U: final report (deterministic service)
